  "description": "Stop wiring Serilog by hand. Add 3 lines of JSON and every ILogger<T> routes logs where they belong — errors to Email, info to Console, traces to Seq. 9 sinks, zero boilerplate. New in 5.1.1: built-in MCP (Model Context Protocol) server — point Claude, Cursor, or any AI assistant at POST /mcp to query sink health, errors, and config with natural language. The only .NET logging library with native AI tooling.",
